abstract: "Municipal code intelligence platform for Crescent City, CA — scrapes ecode360 ordinances and serves them through streaming RAG over Server-Sent Events, a California Code and U.S.C. citation parser, legislative history diffs, and tsunami, earthquake, wildfire and tide alert monitors. Succeeded by crescent-city-intel."
